Error [E1214]: The lock file `.jet/lock` declares unsupported format version `0`.
 Why: During `jet build`, this reader supports lock format version `1`. An unsupported marker may change required meanings, so Jet stopped before using or rewriting the lock.
 Fix: Use a Jet toolchain that supports version `0`, or remove the lock only after confirming its dependencies and rerun an unlocked build to create version `1`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1214
